        <mxCell id="responsive" value="RESPONSIVE PRIORITY\n1 Safety state  ·  2 Context  ·  3 Primary action  ·  4 Core telemetry  ·  5 Secondary info\nReview widths: 375 · 768 · 1024 · 1440px. Reflow; do not merely scale desktop down." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="1090" width="1020" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="WIREFRAME NOTES\n• Semantic status uses text + shape/icon, not color alone.\n• Stale/unavailable/invalid/disconnected telemetry stays visually distinct.\n• E-STOP is safety control, not normal navigation.\n• Fixed nav never covers independently scrollable content.\n• Existing canonical components: DeviceStatePill, StateView, EmergencyStopButton, FleetStationCard, DosingHourlyChart, PermissionMatrix, RoleBadge, InviteForm, OnboardingWizard." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="1190" width="1020" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
